{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53414","headline":"大涤山（题拟） · 白元鉴","name":"大涤山（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天坛绝顶山，髣髴翠微间。\n迹久苔纹碎，云根古木闲。\n丹成人已去，鹤驾未曾还。\n犹有箫吹响，时时下旧山。\n（见《咸淳临安志》卷二四）（按：《全唐诗补逸》卷十八据《洞霄诗集》收《天坛》，爲此诗之别本，然四十字中有二十八字不同，今重录。\n《咸淳临安志》收《大涤洞》一首，首三句与《全唐诗补逸》不同，录如次：「灵山实秀德，仙圣杳难亲。\n水溜空岩石，……」余同，不录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白元鉴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}